 "text": "-->\nAgRail LLC - Location Map\n-->\nLocation Map\nToggle Navigation\nCash Bids & Rates -->\nCash Bids & Rates\nCash Bids Table\nCash Bids Grid\nUSDA Cash Bids\nCurrent Fall Service rates\nDiscount Schedules -->\nDiscount Schedules\n2026 Harvest Rates\nACH Payment Form\nAbout Us\nAbout Us\nProducts & Services\nLocations & Staff\nContact Us\nCash Bids\nCash Bids List\nCash Bids Grid\nUSDA Cash Bids\nMarket Data\nMarket Overview\nFutures\nOptions\nCustom Charts\nSpread Charts\nMarket Heat Maps\nStocks\nReal-Time Markets\nNews\nAg Newswire\nFinancial News\nInsideFutures\nUSDA News & Reports\nAg Commentary\nAg Market Commentary\nWeather\nLocal Weather\nMarket Alerts\nMobile Alerts\nEmail Alerts\nResources\nTrading Calendar\nFutures 101\nCommodity Symbols\nReal-Time Quotes\nFarmer's Almanac\nUSDA Reports\nHome\nAgRail is located near the southern end of the Union Pacific rail yard in Bloomington, Illinois. This allows us to channel truck traffic along Illinois Route 9 with minimal use of side streets. Because of weight restrictions, Please use class 3 route.\nMap to AgRail\nSatellite view of AgRail\nOur Staff\nOffice Manager: Calyn Asmus\ncalyn@agrail.com\nGrain Originator: Noah Jefferson\nnoah@agrail.com\nSuperintendent: Craig Halcomb\ncraig@agrail.com\nAgrail Hours are from 7:00 a.m. - 4:00 p.m.\nTruck Dump Hours 7:00 a.m. - 3:45 p.m.\nshould you need to reach someone in case of an emergency, Please dial 911 and Call Chris Schaffenacker at 217-737-5669\n© 2026 Barchart.com, Inc. All market data is hosted and powered by Barchart .\nInformation presented is provided 'as-is' and solely for informational purposes, not for trading purposes or advice, and is delayed. No representations are made by Barchart as to its informational accuracy or completeness.\nTerms of Use\nPrivacy Policy\nDo Not Sell My Personal Information\nExchange Delays\nBy using this site, you agree to the storage of cookies on your devices for enhanced navigation, site analysis, and Barchart's marketing. Data sharing with social media platforms might occur based on the privacy choices you make on those platforms. For specifics, see our our Privacy Policy .\nAccept",
